From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meta <heavygee@oos-linux.in.lockhouse>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(soup): reconcile spawnSession signature after parking the
 codex/claude import cluster (0.23.1 base bump)

Parking feat/codex-usage-indicator-rebased + feat/claude-session-import +
feat/agent-session-import-picker (see config/driver-manifest.yaml) removed the
codex import feature, but three call-sites/tests were left inconsistent by the
parked layers vs the surviving cursor-acp-resume layer (#991) on the 0.23.1 base:

  1. rpcGateway.spawnSession kept an orphan `importHistory?: boolean` param
     (nothing forwards it; the main SyncEngine.spawnSession wrapper does not
     pass it, so `effort` misaligned into the boolean slot).
  2. The Cursor ACP resume path (SyncEngine) still passed `false` in the
     importHistory position (14 args vs 13) — it meant "don't import" anyway.
  3. The 0.23.1 Codex-sync SessionActionMenu test renders <SessionActionMenu>
     inline without sessionId/sessionTitle, which the session-copy-link layer
     made required props.

Restore/rework these when the import cluster is re-added after its owner rebase.
Verified: bun run typecheck (cli+web+hub) clean with this heal applied.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 hub/src/sync/rpcGateway.ts                      | 1 -
 hub/src/sync/syncEngine.ts                      | 1 -
 web/src/components/SessionActionMenu.test.tsx   | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hub/src/sync/rpcGateway.ts b/hub/src/sync/rpcGateway.ts
index dc4f3c7af..68d1117b1 100644
--- a/hub/src/sync/rpcGateway.ts
+++ b/hub/src/sync/rpcGateway.ts
@@ -172,7 +172,6 @@ export class RpcGateway {
         sessionType?: 'simple' | 'worktree',
         worktreeName?: string,
         resumeSessionId?: string,
-        importHistory?: boolean,
         effort?: string,
         permissionMode?: PermissionMode,
         serviceTier?: string,
diff --git a/hub/src/sync/syncEngine.ts b/hub/src/sync/syncEngine.ts
index 2d144c64f..95c43fdf0 100644
--- a/hub/src/sync/syncEngine.ts
+++ b/hub/src/sync/syncEngine.ts
@@ -1812,7 +1812,6 @@ export class SyncEngine {
             undefined,
             undefined,
             resumeToken,
-            false,
             session.effort ?? undefined,
             preferredPermissionMode,
             session.serviceTier ?? undefined,
diff --git a/web/src/components/SessionActionMenu.test.tsx b/web/src/components/SessionActionMenu.test.tsx
index 444ec72be..e1a52c8bb 100644
--- a/web/src/components/SessionActionMenu.test.tsx
+++ b/web/src/components/SessionActionMenu.test.tsx
@@ -125,6 +125,8 @@ describe('SessionActionMenu - Codex sync action', () => {
                 <SessionActionMenu
                     isOpen={true}
                     onClose={vi.fn()}
+                    sessionId="sess-123"
+                    sessionTitle="Test session"
                     sessionActive={false}
                     onRename={vi.fn()}
                     onExport={vi.fn()}
-- 
2.39.5
